1:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 TNM stage at the time of diagnosis.
2:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            Pre-therapeutic TNM-stage. NAC: Neoadjuvant treatment, FL: First Line treatment, T-CX: Patients who had an cystectomy (CX) prior to first line treatment
3:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     CX: Cystexctomi
4: All patients underwent a pre- (baseline) and post-treatment (4 moths control) PET/CT or MRI, CT and X-ray examination. Representative metastatic sites of all involved organs, were identified as target lesions at the Dep. of Radiology, AUH. Treatment response was evaluated using RECIST 1.1 response criteria. Complete response (CR): Disappearance of all target-lesions and verified pT0 (if the primary tumor were present at the time of FL-treatment). Partial response (PR): at least 30% decrease in the sum of diameter of target lesions. Progressive Disease (PD): at least 20% increase in the sum of diameters of target lesions. Stable Disease (SD): Neither sufficient shrinkage to qualify for PR nor sufficient increase to qualify for PD.
5:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      For patients who recieved both NAC and FL, the FL-treatment response was used for "Overall Treatment response"

